          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "300"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "A first inventory -made in the 1960s- has been updated and edited by Ursula Balzer in 2008; a number of documents which were overlooked originally have been included in it (see inv. nos. add. 1-65) and the packaging has been renewed.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "351"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "Not restricted.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "506"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "Letters from Michail Bakunin 1868-1870, Sophie von Hatzfeldt 1864-1865, Georg Herwegh 1865-1871, Hermann Jung 1868-1873, Ferdinand Lassalle 1863-1864, Wilhelm Liebknecht 1866-1881 and n.d., Julius Motteler 1877-1884, Theodor Remy 1861-1875, Friedrich A. Sorge 1867-1884, Paul Stumpf 1866-1882 and others; some original letters by J.P. Becker; manuscripts; handwritten statutes and rules, proceedings and resolutions; deeds; manuscripts by others; some printed material.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "2",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "520"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "Johann Philipp Becker Papers, inventory number ..., International Institute of Social History, Amsterdam.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "524"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "Complete papers digitized as part of the Centrale Project 2012-2016.\n\n29 security microfilms publication by Fr. Ebert Stiftung 1979.\n\nPartly published in:  Documents relatifs aux militants Belges de L'Association Internationale des Travailleurs. Correspondance 1865-1872.  Textes réunis, établis et annotés par Daisy Eveline Devreese. Louvain/Bruxelles, 1986; Wilhelm Liebknecht,  Briefwechsel mit deutschen Sozialdemokraten . Band 1.  1862-1878.  Hrsg. und bearbeitet von Georg Eckert. Assen, 1973. Band 2.  1878-1884 . Hrsg. von Götz Langkau unter Mitwirkung von Ursula Balzer und Jan Gielkens. Frankfurt/M. [etc.], 1988;  Zeitgenossen von Marx und Engels. Ausgewählte Briefe aus den Jahren 1844 bis 1852.  Hrsg. und annotiert von Kurt Koszyk und Karl Obermann. Assen, 1975.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "2",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "530"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "For reasons of protection of the original documents, only the scans are available for use.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "540"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "These papers were originally part of the historical party-archives of the SPD. The IISH acquired this collection from the SPD in exile in 1938 with financial support of the Centrale Arbeiders-Verzekerings- en Deposito-Bank (the Centrale). The collection, including the papers of Karl Marx, Friedrich Engels, August Bebel, Eduard Bernstein, and Wilhelm Liebknecht, was mentioned in the Annual Report of 1938 (p. 37-42). The contract was signed 19 May 1938.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "1",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "541"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "Becker, Johann Philipp. Born in Frankenthal, Pfalz 1809, died in Geneva 1886; broom maker, later cigar manufacturer and journalist; fled for political reasons to Switzerland in 1838; became a Swiss citizen and participated in the Sonderbund war; was in command of a unit of a revolutionary German army in Southern Germany 1848-1849; member of the Allgemeine Deutsche Arbeiterverein (ADAV) from 1863; participated in the founding of the International Working Men's Association (IWMA) in 1864 and became head of the section for the German speaking countries; one of the founders of the German Sozialdemokratische Arbeiterpartei (SDAP) in 1869; editor of  Der Vorbote  1866-1871 and of  Le Précurseur  1877-1882.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "545"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "German.",
            "@code": "a"
          },
          "@ind1": "",
          "@ind2": "",
          "@tag": "546"
        },
        {
          "marc:subfield": {
            "$text": "Processing Information: Inventory by Ursula Balzer in 2008.\n\nRevised for purposes of digitization by Eva van Oene in 2015.",
            "@code": "a"
